{
    "title": "Ralph Lauren: Luxury Shopping",
    "description": "Download now to shop the World of Ralph Lauren. Enjoy free shipping and gift boxing when you sign in or create a Ralph Lauren account.\r\n \r\nTHE RALPH LAUREN APP \r\nBringing the World of Ralph Lauren to life right at your fingertips. Personalized to your unique preferences and rich with content, the Ralph Lauren App is an elevated shopping experience that allows you to seamlessly shop your online wishlist and your favorite store.  \r\n \r\nSEAMLESS SHOPPING  \r\n\u2022\tShop all Ralph Lauren brands: Collection, Purple Label, Polo, Lauren, Home, and Double RL \r\n\u2022\tEarly access to products with app-exclusive shopping windows  \r\n\u2022\tSign up for first-to-know new arrivals and back in stock notifications  \r\n\u2022\tOrder status alerts to easily track your purchase \r\n\u2022\tSame Day Delivery before 4pm for select items and locations  \r\n\u2022\tCheckout with just a few clicks \r\n\u2022\tCreate an account with Google social logins \r\n\u2022\tSeamless payments with Paypal or buy now, pay later with Klarna \r\n \r\nPERSONALIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE \r\n\u2022\tTake the My Style quiz to curate your shopping preferences  \r\n\u2022\tProduct and content recommendations powered by AI and based on your unique taste \r\n\u2022\t\u201cShop My Style\u201d filters for your favorite product grids  \r\n \r\nCONNECT TO STORES \r\n\u2022\tSave and shop your preferred store  \r\n\u2022\tSign up for notifications on local happenings, store openings, and Ralph\u2019s Coffee events \r\n\u2022\tPick up your online purchases in-store the same day  \r\n\u2022\tLive chat with a stylist and seamlessly schedule in-store appointments \r\n\u2022\tOnce in-store, shop using in-store mode  \r\n\u2022\tYour personal QR code allows for easy check-in  \r\n\u2022\tScan barcodes to see color and size availability, product reviews, and product recommendations. \r\n \r\nSHOP EDITORIAL STORIES \r\n\u2022\tExplore and shop content-rich stories for seasonal style inspiration \r\n\r\nVIRTUAL TRY-ON \r\n\u2022\tVirtually try-on select styles with Snap AR Technology \r\n \r\nRL WARDROBE \r\n\u2022\tA virtual wardrobe experience offering personalized recommendations  \r\n\u2022\tView all recent purchases in your wardrobe  \r\n\u2022\tAdvice on how to style recent purchases  \r\n\u2022\tDiscover what\u2019s new and recommendations on products you may like",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download now to shop the World of Ralph Lauren. Enjoy free shipping and gift boxing when you sign in or create a Ralph Lauren account.<br> <br>THE RALPH LAUREN APP <br>Bringing the World of Ralph Lauren to life right at your fingertips. Personalized to your unique preferences and rich with content, the Ralph Lauren App is an elevated shopping experience that allows you to seamlessly shop your online wishlist and your favorite store.  <br> <br>SEAMLESS SHOPPING  <br>\u2022\tShop all Ralph Lauren brands: Collection, Purple Label, Polo, Lauren, Home, and Double RL <br>\u2022\tEarly access to products with app-exclusive shopping windows  <br>\u2022\tSign up for first-to-know new arrivals and back in stock notifications  <br>\u2022\tOrder status alerts to easily track your purchase <br>\u2022\tSame Day Delivery before 4pm for select items and locations  <br>\u2022\tCheckout with just a few clicks <br>\u2022\tCreate an account with Google social logins <br>\u2022\tSeamless payments with Paypal or buy now, pay later with Klarna <br> <br>PERSONALIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE <br>\u2022\tTake the My Style quiz to curate your shopping preferences  <br>\u2022\tProduct and content recommendations powered by AI and based on your unique taste <br>\u2022\t\u201cShop My Style\u201d filters for your favorite product grids  <br> <br>CONNECT TO STORES <br>\u2022\tSave and shop your preferred store  <br>\u2022\tSign up for notifications on local happenings, store openings, and Ralph\u2019s Coffee events <br>\u2022\tPick up your online purchases in-store the same day  <br>\u2022\tLive chat with a stylist and seamlessly schedule in-store appointments <br>\u2022\tOnce in-store, shop using in-store mode  <br>\u2022\tYour personal QR code allows for easy check-in  <br>\u2022\tScan barcodes to see color and size availability, product reviews, and product recommendations. <br> <br>SHOP EDITORIAL STORIES <br>\u2022\tExplore and shop content-rich stories for seasonal style inspiration <br><br>VIRTUAL TRY-ON <br>\u2022\tVirtually try-on select styles with Snap AR Technology <br> <br>RL WARDROBE <br>\u2022\tA virtual wardrobe experience offering personalized recommendations  <br>\u2022\tView all recent purchases in your wardrobe  <br>\u2022\tAdvice on how to style recent purchases  <br>\u2022\tDiscover what\u2019s new and recommendations on products you may like",
